ter/~typesafe/jev-latest. Submitted state is sent to that provider and billed there. No automatic actions or   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[12;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;3mprovider fallback.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[13;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[14;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRequested tier: fast. Fast mode is on for cliproxyapi/gpt-6-astra.\u001b[22;39m                                                                                   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[16;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[17;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39mThe classifier is already selected with /openai-decisions. Call openai_decide exactly once with state {\"change\":\"README typo fix\",\"tests\":\"pass\"}    \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[18;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m and questions: route (choice: review or proceed), ready (bool), risk (score 1-5). Then list the typed answers.                                       \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[19;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[20;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[21;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m \u001b[39m\u001b[1mopenai_decide\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[39m\u001b[2mstate={\"change\":\"README typo fix\",\"tests\":\"pass\"} questions={\"route